{"id":384,"date":"2026-01-27T12:04:41","date_gmt":"2026-01-27T12:04:41","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost:10005\/?p=384"},"modified":"2026-01-27T12:16:43","modified_gmt":"2026-01-27T12:16:43","slug":"ris-aided-key-generation-multi-cell-systems","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/ris-aided-key-generation-multi-cell-systems\/","title":{"rendered":"\u591a\u5c0f\u533a\u7cfb\u7edf\u4e0bRIS\u8f85\u52a9\u5bc6\u94a5\u751f\u6210\u4e0e\u5e72\u6270\u7ba1\u7406\u65b9\u6cd5"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u95ee\u9898\u5f15\u5165\uff1a\u591a\u5c0f\u533a\u5e72\u6270<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>\u5728\u591a\u5c0f\u533a\u7f51\u7edc\u4e2d\uff0c\u5c0f\u533a\u95f4\u5e72\u6270\uff08Inter-cell Interference\uff09\u662f\u5236\u7ea6\u5bc6\u94a5\u751f\u6210\u901f\u7387\u7684\u5173\u952e\u56e0\u7d20\u3002\u5982\u4f55\u5728\u4fdd\u969c\u5404\u5c0f\u533a\u5408\u6cd5\u7528\u6237\u5b89\u5168\u901a\u4fe1\u7684\u540c\u65f6\uff0c\u6709\u6548\u6291\u5236\u6765\u81ea\u76f8\u90bb\u5c0f\u533a\u7684\u5e72\u6270\uff0c\u662f\u4e00\u4e2a\u4e9f\u5f85\u89e3\u51b3\u7684\u4f18\u5316\u96be\u9898\u3002<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u89e3\u51b3\u65b9\u6848\uff1a\u4ea4\u66ff\u4f18\u5316\u7b97\u6cd5<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6c531013 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"970\" height=\"471\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/1b53ef58-da35-4276-b8a5-523c812a032b.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-387\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/1b53ef58-da35-4276-b8a5-523c812a032b.png 970w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/1b53ef58-da35-4276-b8a5-523c812a032b-300x146.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/1b53ef58-da35-4276-b8a5-523c812a032b-768x373.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u6211\u4eec\u5efa\u7acb\u4e86\u4ee5<strong>\u6700\u5927\u5316\u52a0\u6743\u548c\u901f\u7387\uff08WSKR\uff09<strong>\u4e3a\u76ee\u6807\u7684\u4f18\u5316\u95ee\u9898\u3002\u7531\u4e8e\u76ee\u6807\u51fd\u6570\u662f\u975e\u51f8\u7684\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u63d0\u51fa\u4e86\u4e00\u79cd\u9ad8\u6548\u7684<\/strong>\u4ea4\u66ff\u4f18\u5316\uff08AO\uff09\u7b97\u6cd5<\/strong>\u6765\u5bfb\u627e\u6700\u4f18\u89e3\uff1a<\/h6>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>\u6b65\u9aa41\uff1a<\/strong> \u56fa\u5b9a RIS \u53cd\u5c04\u7cfb\u6570f(v)\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u57fa\u4e8e KKT \u6761\u4ef6\u7684\u62c9\u683c\u6717\u65e5\u4e58\u5b50\u6cd5\u6c42\u89e3\u57fa\u7ad9\u9884\u7f16\u7801\u77e9\u9635 $ \\mathbf{P}_1, \\dots, \\mathbf{P}_K $\u3002<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>\u6b65\u9aa42\uff1a<\/strong> \u56fa\u5b9a\u9884\u7f16\u7801\u77e9\u9635\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u6295\u5f71\u68af\u5ea6\u4e0b\u964d\u6cd5\u6c42\u89e3 RIS \u53cd\u5c04\u7cfb\u6570 f(v)\u3002<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u7406\u8bba\u4e0e\u4eff\u771f\u5206\u6790<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6c531013 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"802\" height=\"656\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/f2c8a1b0-aaf8-4248-b256-b92f9a67471c.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-389\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/f2c8a1b0-aaf8-4248-b256-b92f9a67471c.png 802w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/f2c8a1b0-aaf8-4248-b256-b92f9a67471c-300x245.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:10005\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/f2c8a1b0-aaf8-4248-b256-b92f9a67471c-768x628.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 802px) 100vw, 802px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-fe9cc265 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u4ece\u5de6\u56fe\u4e0d\u96be\u5f97\u51fa\u4ee5\u4e0b\u7ed3\u8bba<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>WSKR\u589e\u957f\u8d8b\u52bf\uff1a<\/strong> \u52a0\u6743\u548c\u5bc6\u94a5\u901f\u7387\u968f\u7740\u53d1\u5c04\u529f\u7387\u7684\u589e\u52a0\u800c\u63d0\u9ad8\uff0c\u4f46\u5728\u9ad8\u529f\u7387\u533a\u57df\u5448\u73b0\u9012\u51cf\u589e\u957f\uff08\u9971\u548c\u8d8b\u52bf\uff09\u3002<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>\u4e0a\u754c\u7d27\u5bc6\u6027\uff1a<\/strong> \u5f53\u57fa\u7ad9\u7aef\u53e3\u6570\u7b49\u4e8e\u5929\u7ebf\u6570\u65f6\uff0c\u63a8\u5bfc\u7684\u7406\u8bba\u4e0a\u754c\u4e0e\u5b9e\u9645\u5bc6\u94a5\u901f\u7387\u76f8\u7b49\uff0c\u9a8c\u8bc1\u4e86\u6211\u4eec\u7406\u8bba\u63a8\u5bfc\u7684\u51c6\u786e\u6027\u3002<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u8bba\u6587\u4fe1\u606f<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<p data-wp-context---core-fit-text=\"core\/fit-text::{&quot;fontSize&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" data-wp-init---core-fit-text=\"core\/fit-text::callbacks.init\" data-wp-interactive data-wp-style--font-size=\"core\/fit-text::context.fontSize\" class=\"has-fit-text\" style=\"font-style:italic;font-weight:600;line-height:5\">L. Hu, C. Sun, G. Li, A. Hu, and D.W.K.Ng, \u201cReconfigurable Intelligent Surface-aided Secret Key Generation in Multi-Cell Systems\u201d, submitted to IEEE Trans. on Comm., 2023. (Major revision) (Q1, IF=8.3)<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u9488\u5bf9\u591a\u5c0f\u533a\u7cfb\u7edf\u4e2d\u7684\u5e72\u6270\u7ba1\u7406\u96be\u9898\uff0c\u672c\u8bfe\u9898\u7ec4\u63d0\u51fa\u4e86\u4e00\u79cd RIS \u8f85\u52a9\u7684\u7269\u7406\u5c42\u5bc6\u94